Package: populismLLM
Title: Cross-Validated LLM Annotation of European Party Manifestos
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Martin", "Rode", email = "martinrode@unav.es",
           role = c("aut")),
    person("Sebastian", "Stöckl", email = "sebastian.stoeckl@uni.li",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(URL = "http://www.sebastianstoeckl.com")))
Description: Replication package (v2026a) for the LLM measurement of populism,
    ideology and liberalism in the 3,371 manifestos of the Manifesto Project
    corpus 2026-1 (MPDS2026a), scored by three model families (Claude Sonnet 4.6,
    GPT-4.1-mini, Gemini 3.5 Flash) with verbatim-quote evidence, and for the
    regressions, the 20,592-specification curve with non-standard errors, the
    construct-independence tests and every table, figure and number of the paper.
    One chain (run_all.R), verified byte-identical against MANIFEST.md5 (R/71).
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
